      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T13:20:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why is this change needed? Since dawn native has access to the commandbuffer level WriteBuffer, don\u0027t we just need to allocate a single intrinsic buffer and then we can keep using that every render pass in every frame?",
      "revId": "66ed630ce9092057334a08ddd00131547562a853",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "442889de_5afe57d0",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 7953
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T14:26:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now, `DawnCommandBuffer::fIntrinsicConstantBuffer` is allocated with `findOrCreateDawnBuffer()` with `Shareable::kNo`. So the buffer cannot be reused until the previous command buffer is submitted and done with GPU. So we found 100s `fIntrinsicConstantBuffer` in WPA trace.\n\nSo we can allocate a single `fIntrinsicConstantBuffer`, and put it in DawnResourceProvider, so all command buffers can just use it. Or we can just allocate the buffer with `Shareable::kYes`.",
      "parentUuid": "17568b54_c30bd9c4",
      "revId": "66ed630ce9092057334a08ddd00131547562a853",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1614b535_df410bbc",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-05-21T14:35:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should just store this on the DawnResourceProvider. You could claim this is kind of similar to how we deal with discardable msaa/stencil attachments, but at least with those there is a lot more that goes into getting one (e.g. size and format). In this case we only every want to create one buffer and keep using it for everything, forever. So it seems better to just have the DawnResourceProvider create one and hold onto it.",
      "parentUuid": "442889de_5afe57d0",
      "revId": "66ed630ce9092057334a08ddd00131547562a853",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
