      "message": "OK. I will do that. \n\nWhat about the comment in https://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/855478/4/src/gpu/graphite/BufferManager.cpp . For other uniform and vertex buffer, if WriteBuffer() is used, they can be shareable as well.",
      "parentUuid": "1614b535_df410bbc",
      "revId": "66ed630ce9092057334a08ddd00131547562a853",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
